<html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="description" content="Draft laporan absensi apel Dinas Sosial Kabupaten Mappi"><title>Absensi & Laporan Apel | Dinas Sosial Kabupaten Mappi</title><script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css"><style>
